Homepage: https://github.com/Blqd/brain

Package: brain-runtime
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), git, jq, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-agent knowledge base runtime
 Brain is a file-based knowledge base with a role-based task queue, curated
 wiki, council mode and git federation for small teams on one LAN repository.
 .
 This package installs the CLI (brain-task, brain-validate, brain-federation,
 ...) and the Python library under /usr/lib/brain-runtime. Bootstrap a vault
 with `setup-brain-v2.sh` after installing.
